    "final_answer": "I'm unable to access your contacts or memory due to an approval requirement. To find the duty manager's contact information, I can help you in a few ways:\n\n1. **Check recent emails** - If you've previously emailed the duty manager, their email might be in your sent/received items\n2. **Search through documents** - There might be documentation about escalation procedures stored as files or documents\n3. **Ask me to search web** - If this is a publicly known company/organization, I can search for escalation contacts\n\nWould you like me to:\n- Search your recent emails for duty manager contacts?\n- Look through any project files or documents that might contain escalation information?\n- Search the web for escalation contacts (if this is a public organization)?\n\nOr if you have the duty manager's name, I can try to resolve their contact details directly."
